# Release and secrets

- Primary gallery is the **VS Marketplace** (`VSCE_PAT`). Cursor proxies `marketplace.cursorapi.com`. Open VSX (`OVSX_PAT`) is optional — unlike kiro-language-pack.
- Never commit tokens, never write them into markdown, never print them. Confirm with `gh secret list` (names only).
- Nothing is published yet. Version is `0.0.0`. Do not tag `v*` until `npm run package` produces a real `.vsix`.
- After a Cursor update (once the pack ships): `npm run detect`, then the check-upgrade / translate / sync flow in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
- Full notes: [docs/publishing.md](../../docs/publishing.md), [docs/roadmap.md](../../docs/roadmap.md).
